<http://data.silknow.org/object/db99159a-8cca-3672-a464-6b06a6e5827a>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Long shawl of printed wool and silk gauze, England, 1850-1853."@en , "Long shawl of printed wool and silk gauze. Vertical bands of foliage are connected by divergent sprays of leaves. In the spaces are elongated cones with an inner stylised flower pattern on a deep pink ground. The border has smaller cones and foliage patterns on a green ground, and the pattern overlaps onto an outer edging of maroon. Colour are pink, maroon, blue, green on a white ground. Two ends are fringed with maroon knotted silk.\n\nThe weave is open gauze except for horizontal and vertical bands 0.75 inch wide of more closely woven silk. These are 8.5 inches apart."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/83e55432-ae60-3102-9605-e37efc90f27d> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Long shawl of printed wool and silk gauze. Vertical bands of foliage are connected by divergent sprays of leaves. In the spaces are elongated cones with an inner stylised flower pattern on a deep pink ground. The border has smaller cones and foliage patterns on a green ground, and the pattern overlaps onto an outer edging of maroon. Colour are pink, maroon, blue, green on a white ground. Two ends are fringed with maroon knotted silk.\n\nThe weave is open gauze except for horizontal and vertical bands 0.75 inch wide of more closely woven silk. These are 8.5 inches apart."@en , "Long shawl of printed wool and silk gauze, England, 1850-1853."@en ;
        ecrm:P43_has_dimension         <http://data.silknow.org/object/db99159a-8cca-3672-a464-6b06a6e5827a/dimension/1> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/db99159a-8cca-3672-a464-6b06a6e5827a/dimension/4> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/db99159a-8cca-3672-a464-6b06a6e5827a/dimension/2> , <http://data.silknow.org/object/db99159a-8cca-3672-a464-6b06a6e5827a/dimension/3> ;
